# Ride north beside the wall, ollie, press I: wallride along it, drop off, land. The wallride is an
# arc (the wall keeps at most combo.wallrideMaxUp of the jump), not a launch up the wall.
park lab
cmd 0 teleport -27.3 -9 0.14 0
hold up 6..90
hold ollie 80..100
tap grind 104
run 400
expect event wallrideStart within 102..115
expect event wallrideEnd within 120..220
expect event comboLanded{name=Wallride} within 140..320
expect no event bail
expect max skater.pos.z < 0.8 over 100..230
